="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ASAI, MANABU</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A foamable rubber composition which comprises 100 parts by weight of a highly saturated copolymer rubber containing nitrile groups, 5 to 100 parts by weight of polyethylene, 3 to 100 parts by weight of a metal salt of an ethylenic carboxylic acid, 0.5 to 10 parts by weight of an organic peroxide, and 1 to 15 parts by weight of a foaming agent is molded by foam molding.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>On moule par moussage une composition caoutchoutée pouvant être transformée en mousse, qui comprend 100 parties en poids d'un caoutchouc copolymère fortement saturé contenant des groupes nitrile, 5 à 100 parties en poids de polyéthylène, 3 à 100 parties en poids d'un sel métallique d'un acide carboxylique éthylénique, 0,5 à 10 parties en poids d'un peroxyde organique et 1 à 15 parties en poids d'un gonflant.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>